 """Taiga-expanded: extensions to the Taiga-S1 command vocabulary and goal space.
 
 Kept in its own package so the changes to upstream files stay small hooks:
-  faces    features on any planar face (+-X, +-Y, +-Z), not only the top face
+  faces    features on any planar face (+-X, +-Y, +-Z), not only the top face, and on
+           origin planes with an offset, extruded symmetrically (cross bores, windows, pins)
   sampler  goals that use the new features, mixed into the training split and
            exposed as new evaluation suites (original suites are unchanged)
 Pure stdlib: imported by FreeCAD's interpreter (runtime) and the torch process.
